{"meta":{"ui":"itinerary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"a2ui","turn":"generate","prompt":"Plan two days in Kyoto as an inline itinerary: a timeline per day with times, places, how to get between them and how long it takes. Each stop expands for details, each day has a checklist of things to book that I can tick off, and a line at the top says how many are left.","text":"{\"version\":\"1.0\",\"createSurface\":{\"surfaceId\":\"kyoto\",\"catalogId\":\"https://a2ui.org/specification/v1_0/catalogs/basic/catalog.json\",\"components\":[{\"id\":\"root\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"header\",\"day1Title\",\"day1Timeline\",\"day1Checks\",\"divider\",\"day2Title\",\"day2Timeline\",\"day2Checks\"],\"align\":\"stretch\"},{\"id\":\"header\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":{\"@path\":\"/summary/remaining\"},\"variant\":\"body\",\"weight\":0},{\"id\":\"day1Title\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Day 1 · Eastern Kyoto\",\"variant\":\"body\"},{\"id\":\"day1Timeline\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d1s1\",\"d1s2\",\"d1s3\"]},{\"id\":\"d1s1\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"child\":\"d1s1Col\"},{\"id\":\"d1s1Col\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d1s1Head\",\"d1s1Details\"]},{\"id\":\"d1s1Head\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"08:30 · Fushimi Inari Taisha\\nTake JR Nara Line to Inari Station (5 min from Kyoto Stn), then walk 1 hr to summit.\"},{\"id\":\"d1s1Details\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Walk time: 2 hr round trip. Arrive early to avoid crowds. Wear comfortable shoes.\",\"variant\":\"caption\"},{\"id\":\"d1s2\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"child\":\"d1s2Col\"},{\"id\":\"d1s2Col\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d1s2Head\",\"d1s2Details\"]},{\"id\":\"d1s2Head\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"11:30 · Kiyomizu-dera\\nBus 206 from Inari area to Kiyomizu-michi (about 25 min), then 10 min uphill walk.\"},{\"id\":\"d1s2Details\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Visit time: 1.5 hr. Ticket about ¥400. Stroll Sannenzaka and Ninenzaka afterwards.\",\"variant\":\"caption\"},{\"id\":\"d1s3\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"child\":\"d1s3Col\"},{\"id\":\"d1s3Col\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d1s3Head\",\"d1s3Details\"]},{\"id\":\"d1s3Head\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"18:00 · Gion evening walk\\nWalk 25 min downhill from Kiyomizu-dera via Higashiyama.\"},{\"id\":\"d1s3Details\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Time: 1.5 hr. Look for geiko around Hanamikoji. Dinner nearby in Pontocho alley.\",\"variant\":\"caption\"},{\"id\":\"day1Checks\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d1c1\",\"d1c2\"]},{\"id\":\"d1c1\",\"component\":\"CheckBox\",\"label\":\"Book Kiyomizu-dera evening illumination (seasonal)\",\"value\":{\"@path\":\"/checks/d1c1\"}},{\"id\":\"d1c2\",\"component\":\"CheckBox\",\"label\":\"Reserve Pontocho dinner\",\"value\":{\"@path\":\"/checks/d1c2\"}},{\"id\":\"divider\",\"component\":\"Divider\"},{\"id\":\"day2Title\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Day 2 · Arashiyama & West\",\"variant\":\"body\"},{\"id\":\"day2Timeline\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d2s1\",\"d2s2\",\"d2s3\"]},{\"id\":\"d2s1\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"child\":\"d2s1Col\"},{\"id\":\"d2s1Col\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d2s1Head\",\"d2s1Details\"]},{\"id\":\"d2s1Head\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"07:45 · Arashiyama Bamboo Grove\\nBus or train: Hankyu Kyoto Line to Arashiyama (about 15 min from Kawaramachi), then walk 5 min.\"},{\"id\":\"d2s1Details\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Time: 45 min. Best before 9:00 for quiet paths.\",\"variant\":\"caption\"},{\"id\":\"d2s2\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"child\":\"d2s2Col\"},{\"id\":\"d2s2Col\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"d2s2Head\",\"d2s2Details\"]},{\"id\":\"d2s2Head\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"10:00 · Tenryu-ji and Togetsukyo Bridge\\nWalk 10 min from the bamboo grove.\"},{\"id\":\"d2s2Details\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"Time: 1.5 hr. Garden ticket about ¥500. Stroll along the Katsura River.\",\"variant\":\"